        },
        "explain": {
          "ua": "Два способи: It is said that he lives in Paris = He is said to live in Paris. Якщо подія в минулому: It is believed that she left = She is believed to have left. Якщо триває зараз: He is thought to be hiding.",
          "ru": "Два способа: It is said that he lives in Paris = He is said to live in Paris. Если событие в прошлом: It is believed that she left = She is believed to have left. Если длится сейчас: He is thought to be hiding."
        },
        "examples": [
